@startuml
title Statechart diagram of the class "Website"

state "Homepage" as Homepage
state "Project View" as ProjectView
state "Photo View" as PhotoView
state "Video View" as VideoView
state "Career Opportunities" as CareerOpportunities
state "Update View" as UpdateView
state "Application Form" as ApplicationForm

Homepage : entry/user navigates to homepage
Homepage --> NavigationBar : user selects project

NavigationBar : entry/project selected
NavigationBar --> ProjectView : user chooses photo view
NavigationBar --> VideoView : user chooses video view

ProjectView : entry/user views photos
ProjectView --> CareerOpportunities : user selects career opportunities

CareerOpportunities : entry/user views career opportunities
CareerOpportunities --> UpdateView : user chooses update view
CareerOpportunities --> ApplicationForm : user chooses application form

UpdateView : entry/user views updates
UpdateView --> [*] : no further action required

ApplicationForm : entry/user opens application form
ApplicationForm --> [*] : submission pending

[*] --> ApplicationSubmitted : job application submitted

ApplicationSubmitted : entry/job application received
ApplicationSubmitted --> CheckApplications : system checks applications

CheckApplications : entry/applications checked
CheckApplications --> [*] : no further action required

@enduml
